WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.950
Mark the offer accepted, draft the lease from it in one click, check the terms and activate it.

2
00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:16.180
A lease starts from the offer the brand agreed to. These are the offers you have sent.

3
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:21.500
Open the offer the brand has said yes to.

4
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.160
Choose Accepted. The units are now reserved for this brand.

5
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.430
A new button appears: Create lease.

6
00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:39.000
Everything comes from the offer: the brand, the units, the rent, the yearly increase and the deposit.

7
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.570
Check the start date and the terms, and change anything agreed at signing.

8
00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:50.980
Choose Create lease. It starts as a draft, so nothing is billed yet.

9
00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:57.640
The draft already shows the area, the rent and the value of the whole contract.

10
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:03.170
Upload the signed copy here, so the lease is complete on file.

11
00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:10.690
Then choose Activate lease. The units become leased and every invoice of the term is created.

12
00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:16.410
The lease is active, and its invoices follow the rent schedule automatically.
